  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Korsimoro Onion Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to achieve a higher price for its onions and to continue to improve production levels. ADF funds will contribute storage facilities; revolving funds to provide access to inputs; compost pits; and production equipment.</narrative>
  </description>
